{%- comment -%}
  Header del negozio (section group "header-group").
  Riferimento: Simple Design System (Figma) → Sections / Header e componenti Navigation Pill + Header Auth.
  Icone: Heroicons.

  - Desktop (da 990px): logo, menu centrale con evidenziazione che scorre tra le voci, ricerca, account, carrello.
    Le voci con sottomenu aprono un pannello (snippet header-panel): mega menu a tutta larghezza se il menu
    ha 3 livelli o se la voce ha un blocco "Mega menu", altrimenti una tendina compatta.
  - Mobile e tablet: cassetto con le voci di primo livello; il secondo livello è lo stesso pannello, che entra da destra.
  - Pannelli = popover nativi: funzionano senza JS. frontend/scripts/header.js (in theme.js) aggiunge apertura
    al passaggio del mouse, posizione dei pannelli, evidenziazione, blocco dello scroll e header "a scomparsa".
  - Contenuti del mega menu: theme blocks blocks/_header-mega-menu.liquid (+ card _header-menu-card),
    collegati alla voce del menu per titolo.
  - Stato sticky: classe .section-header sul wrapper della section (vedi frontend/styles/header.css).
  - Header trasparente (data-transparent): solo sopra una prima section che lo consente ([data-header-overlay]
    della hero), in CSS con le varianti overlay: / overlay-light: (frontend/entrypoints/theme.css). header.js
    aggiunge data-solid oltre la hero, con un menu aperto o con il focus da tastiera nell'header.
{%- endcomment -%}
{% render 'section-colors', section_id: section.id, scheme: section.settings.color_scheme %}
{% render 'section-width', section_id: section.id, width: section.settings.section_width %}
{%- liquid
  assign menu = section.settings.menu
  assign logo_width = section.settings.logo_width
  assign logo_width_2x = logo_width | times: 2
  assign logo_widths = logo_width | append: ', ' | append: logo_width_2x
  assign logo_sizes = logo_width | append: 'px'
  assign account_enabled = false
  if section.settings.show_account and shop.customer_accounts_enabled
    assign account_enabled = true
  endif

  # Selettori di paese/valuta e lingua: solo se attivi e con più di un'opzione (Markets)
  assign show_country = false
  if section.settings.show_country and localization.available_countries.size > 1
    assign show_country = true
  endif
  assign show_language = false
  if section.settings.show_language and localization.available_languages.size > 1
    assign show_language = true
  endif
-%}

{%- comment -%}
  Pannelli dei blocchi "Mega menu": catturati qui per sapere quali voci ne hanno uno, cercando l'id del pannello
  nell'HTML. section.blocks non serve: per i theme blocks dà type "@theme" e nessun setting (misurato il 2026-11-06).
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- capture mega_panels -%}
  {% content_for 'blocks' %}
{%- endcapture -%}

{%- capture pill_class -%}
  relative flex items-center gap-1 rounded-button px-3.5 py-2 text-body leading-none text-foreground transition-colors hover:bg-surface js:hover:bg-transparent aria-[current=page]:font-semibold overlay-light:text-white overlay-light:hover:bg-white/15 overlay-light:focus-visible:outline-white
{%- endcapture -%}

<site-header
  class="group/header relative block border-b border-border bg-background transition-[background-color,border-color] duration-300 ease-theme overlay:border-transparent overlay:bg-transparent overlay:[--color-foreground:var(--color-black)] motion-reduce:transition-none"
  data-sticky="{{ section.settings.sticky_header }}"
  {% if section.settings.transparent_header %}
    data-transparent
  {% endif %}
  {% if section.settings.open_on_hover %}
    data-hover-open
  {% endif %}
  style="--logo-width: {{ logo_width }}px;"
>
  <header class="page-width flex h-18 items-center gap-3 md:h-auto md:min-h-20 md:gap-6 md:py-4">
    {%- comment -%}
      Logo. Sopra una hero con testo chiaro: logo chiaro (se impostato) in dissolvenza incrociata.
      Sotto i 990px può restringersi (min-w-0 + max-w-full sulle immagini): la larghezza scelta dal merchant è un
      massimo, le icone hanno la precedenza. Con un logo largo 200px a 398px la riga sbordava di ~55px, il menu finiva
      fuori dallo schermo e la pagina si allargava (segnalato il 2026-11-10).
    {%- endcomment -%}
    {%- liquid
      # Modalità scura automatica: l'header passa allo scuro se usa lo schema della pagina o uno schema chiaro e neutro
      # (snippets/scheme-goes-dark.liquid); allora il logo chiaro sostituisce quello normale (variante auto-dark:)
      assign header_goes_dark = false
      if settings.dark_mode == 'auto' and settings.dark_mode_scheme != blank
        assign header_scheme = section.settings.color_scheme
        assign page_scheme_id = settings.color_schemes.first.id
        for item in settings.color_schemes
          if item.id == 'scheme-1'
            assign page_scheme_id = item.id
            break
          endif
        endfor
        if header_scheme == blank or header_scheme.id == page_scheme_id
          assign header_goes_dark = true
        else
          capture goes_dark
            render 'scheme-goes-dark', scheme: header_scheme
          endcapture
          if goes_dark == 'true'
            assign header_goes_dark = true
          endif
        endif
      endif

      assign light_logo = nil
      if section.settings.transparent_logo != blank and section.settings.logo != blank
        if section.settings.transparent_header or header_goes_dark
          assign light_logo = section.settings.transparent_logo
        endif
      endif
      assign dark_logo_class = ''
      assign light_logo_dark_class = ''
      if light_logo and header_goes_dark
        assign dark_logo_class = 'auto-dark:opacity-0'
        assign light_logo_dark_class = 'auto-dark:opacity-100'
      endif
      assign light_logo_class = 'absolute inset-0 h-auto w-(--logo-width) max-w-full opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-300 ease-theme overlay-light:opacity-100 motion-reduce:transition-none ' | append: light_logo_dark_class
    -%}
    <a
      href="{{ routes.root_url }}"
      class="relative min-w-0 rounded-sm text-foreground transition-colors duration-300 lg:shrink-0 overlay-light:text-white overlay-light:focus-visible:outline-white"
    >
      {%- if section.settings.logo != blank -%}
        {%- capture logo_class -%}
          h-auto w-(--logo-width) max-w-full{% if light_logo %} transition-opacity duration-300 ease-theme overlay-light:opacity-0 motion-reduce:transition-none {{ dark_logo_class }}{% endif %}
        {%- endcapture -%}
        {{
          section.settings.logo
          | image_url: width: logo_width_2x
          | image_tag:
            loading: 'eager',
            widths: logo_widths,
            sizes: logo_sizes,
            alt: shop.name,
            class: logo_class
        }}
        {%- if light_logo -%}
          {{
            light_logo
            | image_url: width: logo_width_2x
            | image_tag:
              loading: 'eager',
              widths: logo_widths,
              sizes: logo_sizes,
              alt: '',
              class: light_logo_class
          }}
        {%- endif -%}
      {%- else -%}
        <span class="block truncate text-heading">{{ shop.name | escape }}</span>
      {%- endif -%}
    </a>

    {%- comment -%} Menu desktop {%- endcomment -%}
    {%- if menu.links.size > 0 -%}
      <nav data-header-nav class="hidden flex-1 justify-center lg:flex" aria-label="{{ 'general.header.main_navigation' | t }}">
        <ul class="relative flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1" role="list">
          {%- comment -%} Evidenziazione che segue il puntatore e la voce aperta (posizione da header.js) {%- endcomment -%}
          <span
            data-nav-highlight
            aria-hidden="true"
            class="pointer-events-none absolute top-(--highlight-y) left-0 hidden h-(--highlight-h) w-(--highlight-w) translate-x-(--highlight-x) rounded-button bg-surface opacity-0 transition-[translate,width,opacity] overlay-light:bg-white/15 duration-300 ease-theme js:block data-visible:opacity-100 motion-reduce:transition-none"
          ></span>
          {%- for link in menu.links -%}
            {%- liquid
              assign key = link.title | handleize
              assign needle = 'id="HeaderPanel-' | append: key | append: '"'
              assign has_panel = false
              if link.links.size > 0 or mega_panels contains needle
                assign has_panel = true
              endif
            -%}
            <li>
              {%- if has_panel -%}
                <button
                  type="button"
                  popovertarget="HeaderPanel-{{ key }}"
                  data-header-trigger
                  class="group/trigger {{ pill_class }}{% if link.child_active %} font-semibold{% endif %}"
                >
                  {{- link.title | escape -}}
                  {% render 'icon',
                    name: 'chevron-down',
                    class: 'size-4 transition-transform duration-300 ease-theme group-data-open/trigger:rotate-180 motion-reduce:transition-none'
                  %}
                </button>
              {%- else -%}
                <a
                  href="{{ link.url }}"
                  class="{{ pill_class }}"
                  {% if link.current %}
                    aria-current="page"
                  {% endif %}
                >
                  {{- link.title | escape -}}
                </a>
              {%- endif -%}
            </li>
          {%- endfor -%}
        </ul>
      </nav>
    {%- endif -%}

    {%- comment -%} Azioni (SDS Header Auth + Button) {%- endcomment -%}
    {%- comment -%}
      ms-auto sempre, senza varianti: da 990px il menu (flex-1) occupa lo spazio libero e il margine vale 0 da solo,
      sotto spinge le icone a destra. Un `md:ms-0` (750px) non allineato al `lg:flex` del menu (990px) le lasciava
      attaccate al logo tra 750 e 989px (segnalato il 2026-11-10).
    {%- endcomment -%}
    <div class="ms-auto flex items-center gap-2">
      {%- comment -%} Paese/valuta e lingua (da 990px; sotto sono nel cassetto) {%- endcomment -%}
      {%- if show_country -%}
        {% render 'header-localization', type: 'country', part: 'trigger' %}
      {%- endif -%}
      {%- if show_language -%}
        {% render 'header-localization', type: 'language', part: 'trigger' %}
      {%- endif -%}

      {%- if section.settings.show_search -%}
        {%- comment -%} Apre il pannello di ricerca (snippet header-search); data-search-trigger: header.js precarica il JS {%- endcomment -%}
        <button
          type="button"
          popovertarget="HeaderSearch"
          data-search-trigger
          class="button button-subtle button-sm button-icon relative overlay-light:text-white overlay-light:hover:bg-white/15 overlay-light:focus-visible:outline-white"
        >
          {% render 'icon', name: 'magnifying-glass', class: 'size-5' %}
          <span class="sr-only">{{ 'general.search.title' | t }}</span>
          <span class="tooltip tooltip-below" aria-hidden="true">{{ 'general.search.title' | t }}</span>
        </button>
      {%- endif -%}

      {%- comment -%}
        Account cliente: componente di Shopify (accesso senza uscire dal negozio, menu dell'account, aggiornato da
        Shopify), caricato da content_for_header. Variabili di stile in frontend/styles/header.css.
        data-lenis-prevent: il foglio dell'account scorre da solo. Senza JS resta un link normale.
      {%- endcomment -%}
      {%- if account_enabled -%}
        <a
          href="{% if customer %}{{ routes.account_url }}{% else %}{{ routes.account_login_url }}{% endif %}"
          class="button button-subtle button-sm button-icon js:hidden overlay-light:text-white overlay-light:hover:bg-white/15 overlay-light:focus-visible:outline-white"
        >
          {% render 'icon', name: 'user', class: 'size-5' %}
          <span class="sr-only">
            {%- if customer -%}
              {{ 'customer.account.title' | t }}
            {%- else -%}
              {{ 'customer.login.title' | t }}
            {%- endif -%}
          </span>
        </a>
        <shopify-account
          class="hidden js:flex overlay-light:[--account-accent:white]"
          menu="{{ section.settings.customer_account_menu.handle | default: 'customer-account-main-menu' }}"
          data-lenis-prevent
        >
          {%- unless customer -%}
            <span
              slot="signed-out-avatar"
              class="flex size-9 items-center justify-center text-foreground overlay-light:text-white"
            >
              {% render 'icon', name: 'user', class: 'size-5' %}
              <span class="sr-only">{{ 'customer.login.title' | t }}</span>
            </span>
          {%- endunless -%}
        </shopify-account>
      {%- endif -%}

      {%- comment -%}
        data-header-cart: contenuto aggiornato dopo ogni modifica al carrello (frontend/scripts/cart-api.js).
        Con il carrello a cassetto il link apre un dialog (aria-haspopup); senza JS porta alla pagina carrello.
      {%- endcomment -%}
      <a
        href="{{ routes.cart_url }}"
        class="button button-primary button-sm overlay-light:button-inverse overlay-light:focus-visible:outline-white"
        {% if settings.cart_type == 'drawer' %}
          aria-haspopup="dialog"
        {% endif %}
        data-header-cart
      >
        {% render 'icon', name: 'shopping-bag', class: 'size-5' %}
        <span class="hidden md:inline">{{ 'sections.cart.title_short' | t }}</span>
        <span class="sr-only">{{ 'sections.header.cart_count' | t: count: cart.item_count }}</span>
        {%- if cart.item_count > 0 -%}
          <span
            class="min-w-5 rounded-full bg-primary-foreground px-1.5 text-center text-body-sm leading-5 text-primary overlay-light:bg-foreground overlay-light:text-white"
            aria-hidden="true"
          >
            {{- cart.item_count -}}
          </span>
        {%- endif -%}
      </a>

      {%- comment -%} Menu mobile: primo livello; il secondo è il pannello della voce (stesso popover del desktop) {%- endcomment -%}
      <details class="header-drawer group lg:hidden" data-scroll-lock>
        <summary class="button button-subtle button-sm button-icon list-none overlay-light:text-white overlay-light:focus-visible:outline-white [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden">
          {% render 'icon', name: 'bars-3', class: 'size-6 group-open:hidden' %}
          {% render 'icon', name: 'x-mark', class: 'hidden size-6 group-open:block' %}
          <span class="sr-only">{{ 'general.header.menu' | t }}</span>
        </summary>

        <div
          class="header-drawer__panel absolute inset-x-0 top-full z-40 flex h-[calc(100dvh-100%)] flex-col overflow-y-auto overscroll-contain border-t border-border bg-background"
          data-lenis-prevent
        >
          <nav class="flex-1 px-6 py-2" aria-label="{{ 'general.header.main_navigation' | t }}">
            <ul class="flex flex-col" role="list">
              {%- for link in menu.links -%}
                {%- liquid
                  assign key = link.title | handleize
                  assign needle = 'id="HeaderPanel-' | append: key | append: '"'
                  assign has_panel = false
                  if link.links.size > 0 or mega_panels contains needle
                    assign has_panel = true
                  endif
                -%}
                <li class="border-b border-border">
                  {%- capture drawer_item_class -%}
                    flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-4 py-4 text-left text-heading text-foreground{% if link.current or link.child_active %} underline decoration-2 underline-offset-8{% endif %}
                  {%- endcapture -%}
                  {%- if has_panel -%}
                    <button type="button" popovertarget="HeaderPanel-{{ key }}" class="{{ drawer_item_class }}">
                      {{- link.title | escape -}}
                      {% render 'icon', name: 'chevron-right', class: 'size-5 text-muted' %}
                    </button>
                  {%- else -%}
                    <a
                      href="{{ link.url }}"
                      class="{{ drawer_item_class }}"
                      {% if link.current %}
                        aria-current="page"
                      {% endif %}
                    >
                      {{- link.title | escape -}}
                    </a>
                  {%- endif -%}
                </li>
              {%- endfor -%}
            </ul>
          </nav>

          {%- if show_country or show_language -%}
            <div class="divide-y divide-border border-t border-border px-6">
              {%- if show_country -%}
                {% render 'header-localization', type: 'country', part: 'row' %}
              {%- endif -%}
              {%- if show_language -%}
                {% render 'header-localization', type: 'language', part: 'row' %}
              {%- endif -%}
            </div>
          {%- endif -%}

        </div>
      </details>
    </div>
  </header>

  {%- comment -%}
    Velo sulla pagina mentre un mega menu è aperto (da 990px). Il click sul velo è un click fuori dal popover:
    lo chiude il browser (light dismiss), senza attivare i link sotto.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  <div
    aria-hidden="true"
    class="pointer-events-none fixed inset-x-0 top-(--header-bottom) bottom-0 z-30 hidden bg-overlay/50 opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-300 ease-theme lg:block motion-reduce:transition-none group-data-[menu-open=mega]/header:pointer-events-auto group-data-[menu-open=mega]/header:opacity-100"
  ></div>

  {%- comment -%} Pannelli: prima quelli dei blocchi "Mega menu", poi quelli predefiniti delle altre voci con sottomenu {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- comment -%}
    I pannelli sono popover (top layer): il contenitore non li influenza. Serve agli avvisi dell'editor dei
    blocchi non collegati: sotto l'header, sopra la pagina, senza occupare spazio (h-0) né bloccare i click
    (pointer-events solo sui figli).
  {%- endcomment -%}
  <div class="absolute inset-x-0 top-full z-50 h-0">
    <div class="page-width pointer-events-none flex flex-col items-start gap-2 pt-3 *:pointer-events-auto">
      {{ mega_panels }}
    </div>
  </div>
  {%- for link in menu.links -%}
    {%- liquid
      assign key = link.title | handleize
      assign needle = 'id="HeaderPanel-' | append: key | append: '"'
      assign layout = 'compact'
      if link.levels > 1
        assign layout = 'columns'
      endif
    -%}
    {%- if link.links.size > 0 -%}
      {%- unless mega_panels contains needle -%}
        {% render 'header-panel', link: link, layout: layout %}
      {%- endunless -%}
    {%- endif -%}
  {%- endfor -%}

  {%- if section.settings.show_search -%}
    {% render 'header-search',
      quick_links: section.settings.search_quick_links,
      predictive: section.settings.predictive_search
    %}
  {%- endif -%}

  {%- comment -%} Elenchi di paesi e lingue: una volta sola, aperti dal pulsante desktop o dalla riga del cassetto {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- if show_country -%}
    {% render 'header-localization', type: 'country', part: 'popover' %}
  {%- endif -%}
  {%- if show_language -%}
    {% render 'header-localization', type: 'language', part: 'popover' %}
  {%- endif -%}
</site-header>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "t:sections.header.name",
  "tag": "div",
  "class": "section-header",
  "enabled_on": {
    "groups": [
      "header"
    ]
  },
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "_header-mega-menu"
    }
  ],
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "section_width",
      "label": "t:sections.header.settings.section_width.label",
      "info": "t:sections.header.settings.section_width.info",
      "options": [
        {
          "value": "page",
          "label": "t:sections.header.settings.section_width.options.page"
        },
        {
          "value": "full",
          "label": "t:sections.header.settings.section_width.options.full"
        }
      ],
      "default": "page"
    },
    {
      "type": "image_picker",
      "id": "logo",
      "label": "t:sections.header.settings.logo.label"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "logo_width",
      "label": "t:sections.header.settings.logo_width.label",
      "min": 50,
      "max": 250,
      "step": 10,
      "unit": "t:sections.header.settings.logo_width.unit",
      "default": 100
    },
    {
      "type": "link_list",
      "id": "menu",
      "label": "t:sections.header.settings.menu.label",
      "default": "main-menu",
      "info": "t:sections.header.settings.menu.info"
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "open_on_hover",
      "label": "t:sections.header.settings.open_on_hover.label",
      "info": "t:sections.header.settings.open_on_hover.info",
      "default": true
    },
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "sticky_header",
      "label": "t:sections.header.settings.sticky_header.label",
      "options": [
        {
          "value": "none",
          "label": "t:sections.header.settings.sticky_header.options.none"
        },
        {
          "value": "always",
          "label": "t:sections.header.settings.sticky_header.options.always"
        },
        {
          "value": "scroll-up",
          "label": "t:sections.header.settings.sticky_header.options.scroll_up"
        }
      ],
      "default": "scroll-up"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "t:sections.header.settings.header_1.content"
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "transparent_header",
      "label": "t:sections.header.settings.transparent_header.label",
      "info": "t:sections.header.settings.transparent_header.info",
      "default": true
    },
    {
      "type": "image_picker",
      "id": "transparent_logo",
      "label": "t:sections.header.settings.transparent_logo.label",
      "info": "t:sections.header.settings.transparent_logo.info",
      "visible_if": "{{ section.settings.transparent_header }}"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "t:sections.header.settings.header_2.content"
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "show_search",
      "label": "t:sections.header.settings.show_search.label",
      "default": true
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "predictive_search",
      "label": "t:sections.header.settings.predictive_search.label",
      "info": "t:sections.header.settings.predictive_search.info",
      "default": true,
      "visible_if": "{{ section.settings.show_search }}"
    },
    {
      "type": "link_list",
      "id": "search_quick_links",
      "label": "t:sections.header.settings.search_quick_links.label",
      "info": "t:sections.header.settings.search_quick_links.info",
      "visible_if": "{{ section.settings.show_search }}"
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "show_account",
      "label": "t:sections.header.settings.show_account.label",
      "info": "t:sections.header.settings.show_account.info",
      "default": true
    },
    {
      "type": "link_list",
      "id": "customer_account_menu",
      "label": "t:sections.header.settings.customer_account_menu.label",
      "info": "t:sections.header.settings.customer_account_menu.info",
      "default": "customer-account-main-menu",
      "visible_if": "{{ section.settings.show_account }}"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "t:sections.header.settings.header_3.content",
      "info": "t:sections.header.settings.header_3.info"
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "show_country",
      "label": "t:sections.header.settings.show_country.label",
      "default": true
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "show_language",
      "label": "t:sections.header.settings.show_language.label",
      "default": true
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "t:sections.header.settings.header_4.content"
    },
    {
      "type": "color_scheme",
      "id": "color_scheme",
      "label": "t:sections.header.settings.color_scheme.label",
      "info": "t:sections.header.settings.color_scheme.info",
      "default": "scheme-1"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
